            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow">
              <div class="bg-blue-600 p-4 rounded-lg w-fit mb-6">
                <i class="fa fa-users text-white text-3xl"></i>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-4">Member Management</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg">Easily manage community members, roles, and permissions with our intuitive interface.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow">
              <div class="bg-green-600 p-4 rounded-lg w-fit mb-6">
                <i class="fa fa-building text-white text-3xl"></i>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-4">Department System</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg">Create and manage departments with custom templates and role-based access control.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow">
              <div class="bg-purple-600 p-4 rounded-lg w-fit mb-6">
                <i class="fa fa-calendar text-white text-3xl"></i>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-semibold text-2xl mb-4">Event Planning</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg">Schedule and manage community events with detailed information and member notifications.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Member Only Modal -->
        <div id="memberOnlyModal" class="heroui-modal" style="display:none; position:fixed; z-index:2000; left:0; top:0; width:100vw; height:100vh; background:rgba(30,32,44,0.65); align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
          <div style="background:#1e2028; border-radius:16px; padding:2rem; max-width:500px; width:90%; position:relative; border:1px solid #35385a;">
            <button onclick="closeMemberOnlyModal()" aria-label="Close" style="position:absolute; top:1.2rem; right:1.2rem; background:none; border:none; color:#fff; font-size:1.5rem; cursor:pointer; opacity:0.7;"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></button>
            <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
              <i class="fa fa-users" style="font-size:3rem; color:#3b82f6; margin-bottom:1rem;"></i>
              <h3 style="color:#fff; margin:0; font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:600;">Members Only</h3>
            </div>
